WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.576
Jeremy stood on his back legs.

2
00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:10.404
He reached toward the top of the pail.

3
00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:15.526
"Ugh! I am not tall enough!"

4
00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:17.701
Jeremy hopped up.

5
00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:20.460
His fingers reached the rim.

6
00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:23.455
"Yes!" Jeremy said.

7
00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.063
But his fingers slipped.

8
00:00:26.064 --> 00:00:26.961
Plop!

9
00:00:26.962 --> 00:00:30.575
Jeremy fell back into the pail.

10
00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:34.612
"What was that sound?" the farmer said.

11
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:36.572
He looked around.

12
00:00:36.573 --> 00:00:39.379
But he didn't see anything.

13
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:43.557
The farmer sighed.

14
00:00:43.558 --> 00:00:46.934
He tossed out his line again.

15
00:00:46.935 --> 00:00:50.645
"When will a fish bite?" he said.

16
00:00:50.646 --> 00:00:53.449
Jeremy hopped up again.

17
00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.934
This time the pail moved.

18
00:00:56.935 --> 00:00:59.141
Then Jeremy got an idea.

19
00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:01.845
He hopped into the side of the pail.

20
00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:04.424
It rocked.

21
00:01:04.425 --> 00:01:06.426
He hopped harder.

22
00:01:06.427 --> 00:01:09.249
The pail rocked again.

23
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.033
Jeremy hopped one more time.

24
00:01:12.034 --> 00:01:15.582
The pail tipped over!

25
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:19.201
Jeremy hopped away fast.

26
00:01:19.202 --> 00:01:23.972
Suddenly a big hand grabbed Jeremy.

27
00:01:23.973 --> 00:01:27.786
"A frog!" the farmer growled.

28
00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:33.751
"I hate frogs!"

